I'm now verifying the project's directory structure to confirm the `@` alias maps to the correct root. It looks like the file paths suggest that the project root is `National-Diagnostic-Center-main`, so aliasing `@` to `process.cwd()` which will map to the project root makes sense. I will verify if this mapping still works, in case the directory is different.


